   "text": "{\"explanations\":[{\"signal_id\":\"f555e8e4-f58f-40e2-904e-6588ad9ed7c8\",\"explanation\":\"Cash headroom has fallen steadily, from {{fact:0ee5b457-8370-4eb9-854e-e46beb7d7aa9}} in August to {{fact:48ab5ad1-850d-426f-9455-dd7b3b7bd3fd}} in October, with unrestricted cash of {{fact:7c239e69-991c-46fc-a0f6-55507edb8e7b}} against a {{fact:031baf93-5cd6-4ac7-a7c0-46230cff716c}} floor. Revenue is running ahead of plan, so the burn seems to come from spending rather than a sales shortfall. If the pace holds, the cushion narrows quickly.\"},{\"signal_id\":\"41967da0-76cc-4f00-b8a1-1c6c4a41e0c3\",\"explanation\":\"Revenue is at {{fact:0a97fcef-3150-435f-b605-12ceb75fad9f}} of plan against an {{fact:ca916d4e-9eaa-40d4-a7ee-17d5d9e71083}} minimum. Headroom has only edged down, from {{fact:b3a2250f-5be1-470f-acb6-c548e53875fb}} to {{fact:e81f3395-aa39-4bda-a6e2-af0909d9a98e}}, which is a minor change. This signal mainly shows that the falling cash position is not explained by weak sales.\"}],\"ranking\":[\"f555e8e4-f58f-40e2-904e-6588ad9ed7c8\",\"41967da0-76cc-4f00-b8a1-1c6c4a41e0c3\"]}",
   "type": "text"
  }
